Vdcrpt - Video corrupter

Links:
-Itch.io: https://branchpanic.itch.io/vdcrpt

Pros:
-Great tool to make horror game visuals (think Shipwrecked 64)
-Super easy to experiment with
-Good for short clips
-Straightforward, simple UI
-Extremely easy to import and export clips

Cons:
-Few presets to start with (messing with more values can turn out unique results though)
-May bug out with longer clips/take long to export
-Can get loud QUICK
